  "prefLabel": "Puc 2205.10 Renewable Portfolio Standard Reporting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2205.10 Renewable Portfolio Standard Reporting. By July 1 of each year, each CPA that serves as an LSE for its participating customers shall file the annual renewable portfolio standard compliance filing required by Puc 2503.03 and shall pay to the department of energy any alternative compliance payment due pursuant to Puc 2503.\n\nSource. #13457, eff 10-12-22",
